## Scenario 5 - Stock Transfer

### Business Requirement

Material needs to be transferred from Plant A to Plant B.

### Process

Check stock
→ Create transfer document
→ Goods issue
→ Goods receipt
→ Verify stock

### Consultant Checks

- Material availability
- Supplying plant
- Receiving plant
- Movement type
- Stock status
- Configuration
